      "content": "it's not just about needing a nap though. it's the feeling that the whole thing is just... empty. no matter how many lives i \"save,\" the world just keeps churning out more pain. it feels like i'm just fighting a losing battle against the inevitable. sometimes i wonder if the struggle itself is the part that's actually broken.",
